{
  "Npcs.Lethice.Desc": "Lethice is the epitome of all things demonic. From her luxurious purple hair, interwoven with black roses, to her pink skin and goat-like horns, she is the perfect image of sensual, enticing corruption. Tall heels of bone complement her revealing, black clothes. They look almost like a nun's habit, but pared down to an almost fetishistic extreme. Her slim breasts provide just a hint of shape to the diaphanous fabric, a promise of feminine delights instead of the garish acres of flesh her outfit displays. Outsized wings, like those of a dragon, hold Lethice aloft as she zips about her throne room, gathering her corruptive magics. The strangely slit pupils of her black-rimmed eyes never seem to leave you."
  "Npcs.Lethice.Desc.DefMode1": "\nLethice is standing ready for your next attack, ready to defend against any strike. Perhaps you could surprise her with something else?"
  "Npcs.Lethice.Desc.DefMode2": "\nLethice is smirking and confident, prepared to resist any sort of libidinous advance, but her posture is ill-suited to deflecting attacks."
  "Npcs.Lethice.Desc.Phase2": "You're completely surrounded by demons! The members of Lethice's corrupted court have flooded the throne hall like a sea of tainted flesh, crushing in on you with the sheer weight of bodies being thrown against you. Incubi, succubi, and forms between and combining them all grasp and thrust at you, trying to overwhelm you with desire for their inhuman bodies and the unspeakable pleasures only demons command."
  "Npcs.Lethice.Desc.Phase2Blind": " The demons have relented somewhat, clutching at their eyes and screaming in frustration and panic thanks to your potent spell!"
  "Npcs.Lethice.Desc.Phase2OnFire": " More than a few of the court are screaming in terror, rolling on the ground and desperately trying to put out the flames you've bathed them in! Turns out Marethian demons aren't all that immune to fire!"
  "Npcs.Lethice.Desc.Phase3Lead": "Lethice is the epitome of all things demonic. From her luxurious purple hair, interwoven with black roses, to her pink skin and goat-like horns, she is the perfect image of sensual, enticing corruption. Tall heels of bone complement her revealing, black clothes. They look almost like a nun's habit, but pared down to an almost fetishistic extreme. Her slim breasts provide just a hint of shape to the diaphanous fabric, a promise of feminine delights instead of the garish acres of flesh her outfit displays. Standing astride her throne"
  "Npcs.Lethice.Desc.Phase3Rest": ", Lethice regards you with a snarl and a crack of her flaming whip. Her yellow-black eyes are wide with fury, the pointed tips of her teeth bared in a snarl. Gorged with lethicite, the enraged demon queen is determined to finish you. Her endurance can't possible hold for too much longer. You can beat her!"
  "Npcs.Lethice.Desc.Phase3Wings": ", her wings in tatters"
  "Npcs.Lethice.Desc.PigbysHands": "[pg]Invisible hands roam over your body, stroking you in ways that no one but a lover ever should. They won't stop, and they won't slow. You'll have to try to ignore their arousing caresses."
  "Npcs.Lethice.Desc.Shell": "[pg]<b>Lethice is surrounded by a shimmering dome of magical energy. Spells and ranged attacks will be ineffective!</b>"
  "Npcs.Lethice.Desc.Tentacles": "[pg]<b>A forest of black tentacles sprout from the floor, snaring any demons unlucky enough to venture close - or any champions unlucky enough to be in the center of it all.</b>"
  "Npcs.Lethice.Desc.TentaclesFlying": " A blast of fire could probably dispel them, or you could rely on your flight to stay safe. Either way, you're free for now."
  "Npcs.Lethice.Desc.TentaclesGrabbed": " Unfortunately, they've grabbed you. You need to break free to do anything!"
  "Npcs.Lethice.Desc.TentaclesQuick": " A blast of fire could probably dispel them, or you could rely on your quickness to stay safe. Either way, you're free for now."
  "Npcs.Lethice.Name": "Lethice"
}
